{"title": "Elturel", "pageid": 11306, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Elturel", "categories": ["Locations"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:The_Descent_of_Elturel.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ad/The_Descent_of_Elturel.png/400px-The_Descent_of_Elturel.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ad/The_Descent_of_Elturel.png/600px-The_Descent_of_Elturel.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ad/The_Descent_of_Elturel.png/800px-The_Descent_of_Elturel.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ad/The_Descent_of_Elturel.png/400px-The_Descent_of_Elturel.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"210\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ad/The_Descent_of_Elturel.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>The Descent</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Elturel</b> is a city in the Western Heartlands of West <a href=\"/wiki/Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"Faerûn\">Faerûn</a>. The <a href=\"/wiki/The_Risen_Road\" title=\"The Risen Road\">Risen Road</a> connects <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldur's Gate</a> and Elturel, running parallel to the <a href=\"/wiki/River_Chionthar\" title=\"River Chionthar\">River Chionthar</a>. The <a href=\"/wiki/Hellriders\" title=\"Hellriders\">Hellriders</a> were once the city's primary armed force.\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r356266\">.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{display:grid;margin:10px 4px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{padding:8px 16px;margin:auto}@media screen and (max-width:779px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-top:10px;padding:8px 2px;border-left:0!important;grid-row:2;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:3;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{justify-content:center!important}}@media screen and (min-width:780px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left{margin-left:10px;border-left:2px solid #3d3d3d!important;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-right:10px;border-left:0!important;border-right:2px solid #3d3d3d;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:3}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:1}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:2;grid-column:2}}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{margin-left:auto;margin-right:32px;font-size:smaller;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{font-size:300%;font-family:serif;color:#3d3d3d;line-height:1em}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin{margin-bottom:auto;margin-right:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{margin-top:auto;margin-left:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text{font-style:italic}</style><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: center\"><blockquote style=\"font-size: 110%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">Trundling, mashing, mincing, crushing, grinding, blasting, biting! Hear their peeling thunder, their roaring flames, their clicking, whirring, metallic melody, and know that the hellfire engines of Avernus are on the move!</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— Edict in Elturel</div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p>Elturel was briefly dragged into <a href=\"/wiki/Avernus\" title=\"Avernus\">Avernus</a> as part of an infernal conspiracy, a terrible event referred to as \"The Descent\" or \"The Fall of Elturel\". After the city returned to the Heartland surface, fear and distrust led to the exile of Elturel's <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tiefling\" title=\"Tiefling\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Race_Tiefling.png/25px-Race_Tiefling.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Race_Tiefling.png/38px-Race_Tiefling.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Race_Tiefling.png/50px-Race_Tiefling.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tieflings\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Race_Tiefling.png/25px-Race_Tiefling.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/66/Race_Tiefling.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tiefling\" title=\"Tiefling\">Tieflings</a>. The <a href=\"/wiki/Tiefling_refugees\" title=\"Tiefling refugees\">tiefling refugees</a>, led by former Hellrider <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Zevlor\" title=\"Zevlor\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Zevlor.png/25px-Portrait_Zevlor.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Zevlor.png/38px-Portrait_Zevlor.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Zevlor.png/50px-Portrait_Zevlor.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Zevlor\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Zevlor.png/25px-Portrait_Zevlor.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Portrait_Zevlor.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Zevlor\" title=\"Zevlor\">Zevlor</a>, can be first encountered in the <a href=\"/wiki/Emerald_Grove\" title=\"Emerald Grove\">Emerald Grove</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a> and then throughout <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Two\" title=\"Act Two\">Act Two</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a>.\n</p><p>Elturel's Descent is the main plot of the 2019 Dungeons &amp; Dragons adventure <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate:_Descent_into_Avernus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Baldur's Gate: Descent into Avernus\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate:_Descent_into_Avernus\">Baldur's Gate: Descent into Avernus</a></span>, which was developed and released as a prequel to <i><a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a></i>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_items\">Related items</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><spa